== conclusion ==
  Root cause = TEST SPEC / POPULATION MISMATCH, not a quantizer defect:
   * fixture population (flux_min=0, uniform) has exact p95 = 1/51 = 1.9608% > 1.8%;
   * the 1.8% reading came from the real DR3SP catalogue (flux_min>0, non-uniform), which lowers the relative residual;
   * the threshold is therefore not applicable to this fixture, and its cited authority is no longer in the repo.
  Fix (no threshold loosening): keep tolerances.GAIA_QUANT frozen; make the case assert the fixture-appropriate closed form and register the spec threshold as a population-conditional gate (flux_min implied by the reading, m* ≈ 1.144Δ).
